"Bovo is a Gomoku (from Japanese 五目並べ - lit. \"five points\") like game for"
" two players, where the opponents alternate in placing their respective"
" pictogram on the game board. (Also known as: Connect Five, Five in a row, X"
" and O, Naughts and Crosses)"
